{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51536","headline":"冬日书黎少府山斋 · 唐廪","name":"冬日书黎少府山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱此林亭绝，重游亦似新。\n山秋同鹤过，水落见鸟频。\n映沼荷全绿，侵檐柳尚春。\n惜哉无别墅，共作白云人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐廪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}